<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμᾰτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put the finger down the throat to cause sickness</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				138
			</span></i> (perh.
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμαπέως</span>
			, but cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμματέων: ψηλαφῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>implant</i> a sting, of a bee, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				809
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμματούμενος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μασώμενος</span>
			, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδατούμενος</span>
			 in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				791
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
